# Straight down the middle lane into the first rival: we bump into its back
# (and bounce off, slower), then pull out to the left and overtake it.
wait-serial "AGK t0"
mark go
press up 250
screenshot bump
mark bumped
expect-serial "bumps=[1-9]"
expect-serial "AGK sfx bump"
expect-sound go bumped          # the engine, the music, the crunch
press up+left 15
press up 150
screenshot overtaken
expect-no-serial "ERR|STACK SMASHED"
